    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who was living a normal life without any other place, lost his wallet one day without noticing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please help me find my wallet by manipulating the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characteristics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D Exploratory Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >an immersive story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original illustration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a simple one-man production game made with RPG Maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It only uses the keyboard, and it's easy to play by examining objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn the story through many illustrations and lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The play time is short, so you can enjoy it simply, and there is one ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It includes some flashing scenes, violent situations, mental illness, unpleasant sound, and injury expressions.</p>",
